  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Righteous Stomp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Righteous-stomp.png\" title=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Righteous-stomp.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Deals Divine damage to multiple adjacent enemies and may cause knockback.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Righteous Stomp</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Offensive\" title=\"Offensive\">Offensive Skill</a> that deals Divine damage to multiple enemies and may cause knockback.  Number of enemies hit as well as damage dealt increase as you gain levels of Righteous Stomp.\n</p><p>Damage is based on your <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect\" title=\"Intellect\">Intellect</a> but also increases as you add levels of Righteous Stomp.\n</p><p>Cooldown: Starts off with 20 seconds and gradually becomes 15 seconds as you add levels of Righteous Stomp.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Deals Divine X damage to Y enemies within 5 meters and may cause knockback.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 13\n</td><td> 18\n</td><td> 23\n</td><td> 28\n</td><td> 33\n</td><td> 38\n</td><td> 43\n</td><td> 48\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 20.5\n</td><td> 29.6\n</td><td> 38.7\n</td><td> 47.8\n</td><td> 56.9\n</td><td> 66.1\n</td><td> 75.2\n</td><td> 84.3\n</td><td> 93.4\n</td><td> 102.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X *\n</td><td> 7-17\n</td><td> 16-27\n</td><td> 25-37\n</td><td> 34-47\n</td><td> 43-57\n</td><td> 53-67\n</td><td> 62-77\n</td><td> 71-87\n</td><td> 80-97\n</td><td> 89-107\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 6\n</td><td> 7\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 9\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 11\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 3340\n</td><td> 8908\n</td><td> 14476\n</td><td> 20044\n</td><td> 25613\n</td><td> 31181\n</td><td> 36749\n</td><td> 42317\n</td><td> 47885\n</td><td> 53453\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">17\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">18\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">19\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 53\n</td><td> 58\n</td><td> 63\n</td><td> 68\n</td><td> 73\n</td><td> 78\n</td><td> 83\n</td><td> 88\n</td><td> 93\n</td><td> 98\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 111.6\n</td><td> 120.7\n</td><td> 129.8\n</td><td> 138.9\n</td><td> 148.0\n</td><td> 157.2\n</td><td> 166.3\n</td><td> 175.4\n</td><td> 184.5\n</td><td> 193.6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X *\n</td><td> 98-118\n</td><td> 107-128\n</td><td> 116-138\n</td><td> 125-148\n</td><td> 135-158\n</td><td> 144-168\n</td><td> 153-178\n</td><td> 162-188\n</td><td> 171-198\n</td><td> 133-208\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> 22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 59022\n</td><td> 64590\n</td><td> 70158\n</td><td> 75726\n</td><td> 81294\n</td><td> 86862\n</td><td> 92431\n</td><td> 97999\n</td><td> 103567\n</td><td> 109135\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
